WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.350
Jewish tradition counts one verse
as the very first commandment:

2
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:06.600
be fruitful, and multiply.

3
00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:11.230
A Jewish marriage is called
kiddushin, a word linked to holiness.

4
00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:15.570
So sex within marriage is a
mitzvah, not something shameful.

5
00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:18.180
Yet the same law sets many limits.

6
00:00:18.230 --> 00:00:22.140
Why would something counted as
a mitzvah need so many rules?

7
00:00:22.190 --> 00:00:24.410
In this mission, you'll compare Orthodox,

8
00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:27.650
Reform and Liberal views
on same-sex relationships.

9
00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:32.660
Then you'll read what the Torah says
about a couple becoming one flesh.

10
00:00:32.710 --> 00:00:36.980
Your mission: explain why
Jewish law treats sex as holy,

11
00:00:37.030 --> 00:00:39.000
and why it also sets limits.
